.Dd October 22, 2014
.Dt VIRTIO_CONSOLE 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm virtio_console
.Nd VirtIO Console driver
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd device virtio_console
.Pp
In
.Xr loader.conf 5 :
.Cd virtio_console_load="YES"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
device driver provides support for VirtIO console devices.
.Pp
The console device may have one or more ports.
Each port is similar to a simple serial interface, and
each port is accessible through
.Xr tty 4 .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/dev/ttyV?.??" -compact
.It Pa /dev/ttyV?.??
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tty 4 ,
.Xr virtio 4
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Bryan Venteicher Aq Mt bryanv@FreeBSD.org
